<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Study the fundamentals of the English language, with a focus on developing the four skills: listening, speaking, reading, and writing. The course emphasizes sentence structure and basic vocabulary to help students understand how to use sentences in English. It also highlights different reading strategies, including news, short stories, long texts, and comprehension skills. Students will be trained to listen to vocabulary and sentence structures, enabling them to use them effectively at a basic level.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
